<section class="sec" id="us-intent" data-hub-us="20261029" data-tag="kakobuy-es-us-gap-20261029">
  <h2 class="stit">United States intent · USPS / CBP (hub-only)</h2>
  <p class="pp">USA shows strong impressions on this hub with near-zero clicks. This block is shipping / customs framing only — it does <strong>not</strong> compete with the Independent Index spreadsheet hero.</p>
  <div class="local-box" style="margin:16px 0 0;max-width:820px">
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Estimator destination: United States</strong> — pick US, not “North America”, not a EU desk TLD.</li>
      <li><strong>Address</strong> — US street + <strong>ZIP</strong>. This hub does not file CBP entries.</li>
      <li><strong>Duties</strong> — SKU says tax-free / prepaid / collect. <strong>USPS</strong> or FedEx can add a collect fee. Source: <a href="https://www.cbp.gov/" rel="noopener">CBP</a> the morning you ship — no invented de-minimis dollar.</li>
      <li><strong>Last mile</strong> — often <strong>USPS</strong> or a commercial integrator after export.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="money" style="margin-top:12px">Deep page: <a href="/shipping-to-us/">/shipping-to-us/</a> · Brand spreadsheet / dataset CTA: <a href="/kakobuy-spreadsheet/">/kakobuy-spreadsheet/</a> · <a href="/finds-dataset/">/finds-dataset/</a> · <a href="/kakobuy-coupons/">/kakobuy-coupons/</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="official-promo">
  <h2 class="stit">Official kakobuy.com 图文 — 9 Oct 2026</h2>
  <p class="pp">Measured on <a href="https://www.kakobuy.com/" rel="noopener">kakobuy.com</a>. Top bar <strong>Register to get ¥3000</strong>. Announcements: <strong>New users sign up and get $410 coupons</strong>, <strong>EU Duty-Free Shipping Lines Update</strong>, <strong>EU Category-Based Customs Fees: Pay Only €3 Per Parcel</strong>, and a $105 super gift parcel. Search / Sign Up chrome is orange <strong>#FF5C00</strong> / Kakobuy wordmark. Official Help is the live site — this desk <strong>does not invent a free-day count</strong>. Coupon stacking stays on ranked <a href="/kakobuy-coupons/">/kakobuy-coupons/</a>, not this docs title. Email <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="7e1d10181a464b4c48474e4d4c48484f3e19131f1712501d1113">[email&#160;protected]</a>. Discord <a href="https://discord.gg/XAbKcnzmcX" rel="noopener">discord.gg/XAbKcnzmcX</a>.</p>
